<<
/Title (Self-reflection is essential in the proper exercise of freedom. It helps us avoid acting based on impulse or emotions and encourages us to think about the effects of our actions. By reflecting before we decide, we can make wiser choices that benefit ourselves and others.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 467 0 R
/Prev 1692 0 R
/Next 1709 0 R
>>
