1709 0 obj
<<
/Title (Human freedom is not absolute. Although we are free to make our own choices, we must exercise that freedom with self-control, responsibility, and respect for others. True freedom means recognizing our limits and making decisions that are beneficial rather than harmful.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 467 0 R
/Prev 1707 0 R
/Next 1711 0 R
>>
endobj
